// Modifier: DIA-NN 2.3.0 instead of the default 1.8.1 image. The two name their outputs
// differently (parquet report and .parquet.skyline.speclib, against .tsv and .tsv.speclib),
// so a change to anything that reads DIA-NN output needs both.
// Pulling this image means accepting the DIA-NN 2.3.0 license its tag names.
params.images.diann = 'quay.io/mauraisa/diann:I_agree_to_the_DiaNN_2.3.0_license'
